==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|en-au-day in, day out.ogg|Audio (AU)}}

===Adverb===
{{head|en|adverb|head=[[day]] [[in]], day [[out]]}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} Every day; [[daily]]; [[constantly]] or [[continuously]] (especially, of something that has become [[routine]] or [[monotonous]]).
#: ''Even if you like peanut butter sandwiches, eating the same sandwiches '''day in, day out''' will get old.''

